{"prompt": {"messages": [{"role": "system", "content": "You are a helpful assistant that translates Python code to Java 8 code. The code should reads and writes I/O from the console."}, {"role": "user", "content": "Translate the following PyPy 3 code to Java 8 code. The code reads and writes I/O from the console. Your translated code should have the exact same functionality as the given code, meaning that it should have the same output for any given input.\nPrint your translated code and also the confidence score you give to your translation. The confidence score should be a number between 0 and 1. The format of the output should be:\n<translated_code>\n<your_translated_code>\n</translated_code>\n<confidence>\n<your_confidence_score>\n</confidence>\nDo not provide any other text or markdown fences.\n\nHere is the original PyPy 3 code you have to translate:\n<original_code>\nfrom functools import lru_cache\nimport itertools\n\ndef invnum(seq):\n    N = len(seq)\n    res = 0\n    for i in range(N):\n        for j in range(i+1, N):\n            if seq[i] > seq[j]:\n                res += 1\n    return res\n\ndef naive(N, k, flag):\n    res = 0\n    for p in itertools.permutations(range(N), N):\n        for q in itertools.permutations(range(N), N):\n            if ((p < q) or (not(flag))) and (invnum(p) - invnum(q) > k):\n                res += 1\n    return res\n\nn, mod = map(int, input().split())\n\n# Use iterative DP with explicit table instead of recursion\ndef solve_iterative(N, k_target, flag_target):\n    # invnum for permutations of length up to N\n    max_inv = (N * (N - 1)) // 2\n    \n    # dp[length][k_diff][flag] = count\n    # We'll use dictionary for sparse storage\n    dp = {}\n    \n    # Base case: length 1\n    for k in range(-max_inv - 1, max_inv + 2):\n        for f in [0, 1]:\n            if f:\n                dp[(1, k, f)] = 0\n            else:\n                dp[(1, k, f)] = 1 if k < 0 else 0\n    \n    # Fill DP table\n    for length in range(2, N + 1):\n        invnum_INF = (length * (length - 1)) // 2\n        for k in range(-invnum_INF - 1, invnum_INF + 1):\n            for f in [0, 1]:\n                res = 0\n                for delta in range(-length + 1, length):\n                    if f and delta > 0:\n                        continue\n                    wt = min(length - delta, delta + length)\n                    prev_k = k - delta\n                    prev_f = (delta == 0) & f\n                    if (length - 1, prev_k, prev_f) in dp:\n                        res += dp[(length - 1, prev_k, prev_f)] * wt\n                        res %= mod\n                dp[(length, k, f)] = res % mod\n    \n    return dp.get((N, k_target, flag_target), 0)\n\nans = solve_iterative(n, 0, 1) % mod\nprint(ans)\n</original_code>\n"}], "temp": 0, "sample_size": 1, "logprobs": true, "model": "qwen/qwen3-coder-next"}, "response": {"samples": [{"content": "<translated_code>\nimport java.util.*;\n\npublic class Main {\n    public static void main(String[] args) {\n        Scanner sc = new Scanner(System.in);\n        int n = sc.nextInt();\n        int mod = sc.nextInt();\n        \n        int ans = solveIterative(n, 0, 1, mod) % mod;\n        System.out.println(ans);\n    }\n    \n    static int solveIterative(int N, int kTarget, int flagTarget, int mod) {\n        int maxInv = (N * (N - 1)) / 2;\n        \n        // Using HashMap for sparse storage: key is \"length,k,flag\"\n        Map<String, Integer> dp = new HashMap<>();\n        \n        // Base case: length 1\n        for (int k = -maxInv - 1; k <= maxInv + 1; k++) {\n            for (int f = 0; f <= 1; f++) {\n                if (f == 1) {\n                    dp.put(key(1, k, f), 0);\n                } else {\n                    dp.put(key(1, k, f), (k < 0) ? 1 : 0);\n                }\n            }\n        }\n        \n        // Fill DP table\n        for (int length = 2; length <= N; length++) {\n            int invnumINF = (length * (length - 1)) / 2;\n            for (int k = -invnumINF - 1; k <= invnumINF + 1; k++) {\n                for (int f = 0; f <= 1; f++) {\n                    int res = 0;\n                    for (int delta = -length + 1; delta < length; delta++) {\n                        if (f == 1 && delta > 0) {\n                            continue;\n                        }\n                        int wt = Math.min(length - delta, delta + length);\n                        int prevK = k - delta;\n                        int prevF = ((delta == 0) ? 1 : 0) & f;\n                        String prevKey = key(length - 1, prevK, prevF);\n                        if (dp.containsKey(prevKey)) {\n                            res = (res + dp.get(prevKey) * wt) % mod;\n                        }\n                    }\n                    dp.put(key(length, k, f), res % mod);\n                }\n            }\n        }\n        \n        return dp.getOrDefault(key(N, kTarget, flagTarget), 0);\n    }\n    \n    static String key(int length, int k, int flag) {\n        return length + \",\" + k + \",\" + flag;\n    }\n}\n</translated_code>\n<confidence>\n0.65\n</confidence>", "token_logprobs": [-0.00010001159535022452, -4.6491513785440475e-06, -9.536738616588991e-07, -0.00017557987303007394, -3.266281055402942e-05, -0.002824367256835103, -0.3546481728553772, -7.152531907195225e-06, -8.344646857949556e-07, -7.557583012385294e-05, -0.05488286912441254, -0.048591870814561844, -0.04451397806406021, -9.536738616588991e-07, -0.014418227598071098, -1.4662635294371285e-05, -1.6689286894688848e-06, -4.768370445162873e-07, -2.9205850296420977e-05, -7.152555099310121e-07, -2.7418097943154862e-06, -1.7881377516459906e-06, -3.397406908334233e-05, -0.06768744438886642, -3.933898824470816e-06, -2.3841855067985307e-07, -7.629365427419543e-06, -4.0531076592742465e-06, -3.576272320060525e-06, -2.8490614567999728e-05, -3.683499380713329e-05, -0.08894447237253189, -0.001702408422715962, -1.1920928244535389e-07, -2.026555